<h3><u>Musafiran-e-musibat</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Musafiran-e-musibat</u></strong></p>

<p>Na mehmil hai na haudaj hai,</p>

<p>Na lashkar ki wo sajdhaj hai,</p>

<p>Na sarpe alam na chadar hai,</p>

<p>Allah ye kaisa manzar hai,</p>

<p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>

<ol>
 <li>safar se aate hai soghate dard laate hai
 <p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>kiya salaam muhammed ke aastane ko,
 <p>pataa ke aaye hai zehra ke sab gharane ko,</p>

 <p>na kar kubool tu hum bekaso ke aane ko,</p>

 <p>ye nawha karte hai aur ashk khu(n) bahaate hai</p>

 <p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>madina hum tere waali ko aaye hai kho kar,
 <p>madina kufe me sar nange hum phire dardar,</p>

 <p>madina daaghe rasan hai humare shaano par,</p>

 <p>uthaa ke haath madine ko ye sunaate hai</p>

 <p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>har ek kadam hai buka kab labo pe bayn nahi,
 <p>hamaye zindaa pa zehra ka noor ayn nahi,</p>

 <p>madina akbaro qasim nahi hussain nahi,</p>

 <p>ye kaise kaise jawaan the jo yaad aate hai</p>

 <p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>madine waalo kaho us behan ki kya taqdir,
 <p>jo dekhe apne biradar ke halq par shamsheer,</p>

 <p>lahu me ghark jo dekhe hussain ki tasveer,</p>

 <p>lahu me kya yuhi baayi ka sar dikhate hai</p>

 <p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>batawo kahte hai kya sab us amma jayi ko,
 <p>jo arbaeen talak de kafan na bhayi ko,</p>

 <p>bahan dikhayegi mu(n) kis tarha khudayi ko,</p>

 <p>kafan diya hai na unki lehed banaate hai</p>

 <p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>chala bashir ye deta huwa khabar har jee,
 <p>magar mehelaye hashim me dekhta hai kya,</p>

 <p>ke ik mariza sare raah hai khari tanha,</p>

 <p>hai muntazir ke wo kunbe ke log aate hai</p>

 <p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>khabar ye phayli to matam har aik ghar me huwa,
 <p>nikal nikal pari sab aurate barehnapaa,</p>

 <p>ghiri zamin pe sughra ke uspe charkh gira</p>

 <p>ye soghwaar hai sughra ke paas ate hai</p>

 <p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>fizae dard me lekar udaasiya aayi,
 <p>shapar se lit ke idher bhukhi pyasiya aayi,</p>

 <p>utho rasul tumhari nawasiya ayi,</p>

 <p>ye khudko untho se ehle haram ghiraate hai</p>

 <p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>jo aayi kaan me awaaze banue muztar</li>
</ol>

<p>kaha ho ay mere wali imame jinno bashar,</p>

<p>tarap ke rehgayi sughra bapa huwa mehshar,</p>

<p>&quot;kabir&quot; bas ab falaq thartharate hai</p>

<p>(musafirane musibat, watan me aate hai) x2</p>
</p>